<title>UK: SOCCER-UEFA CUP FIRST PRELIMINARY ROUND SECOND LEG RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UEFA CUP FIRST PRELIMINARY ROUND SECOND LEG RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of UEFA Cup first</p>
<p>preliminary round, second leg soccer matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Bucharest: Dinamo Bucharest (Romania) 1 KR Reykjavik</p>
<p>(Iceland) 2 (halftime 1-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Dinamo Bucharest - Iulian Chirita 42</p>
<p>KR Rejkyavik - Rikhardur Dadasson 12, 22</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
<p>KR Reykjavik win 4-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Bucharest: Otelul Galati (Romania ) 4 HIT Gorica</p>
<p>(Slovenia) 2 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Otelul Galati - Vali Stefan 20, 27, Adrian State 63, Ioan</p>
<p>Viorel 75</p>
<p>HIT Gorica - Nenad Proteja 88, Mirsad Demirovici 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000</p>
<p>Aggregate 4-4, HIT Gorica win on away goals rule</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Yerevan: Yerevan (Armenia) 0 Dnipro Dnipropetrovsk</p>
<p>(Ukraine) 2 (0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: Ivan Getsko 41, Viktor Belkin 89</p>
<p>Red cards:</p>
<p>Yerevan - Raznik Grigoryan 87, Malal 89</p>
<p>Dnipro - Igor Kharkovchenko 87</p>
<p>Attendance: 500</p>
<p>Dnipro win 8-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Brno: Boby Brno (Czech Republic) 6 Inkaras Kaunas</p>
<p>(Lithuania) 1 (3-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Boby - Vladimir Chaloupka 7, 50, Zdenek Valnoha 15, 54,</p>
<p>Pavel Holomek 25, Michal Kolomaznik 63</p>
<p>Inkaras Kaunas - Rimvydas Bakus 16</p>
<p>Attendance 16,800</p>
<p>Boby won 7-4 on aggregate</p>
<p>In Poti: Kolkheti-1913 Poti (Georgia) 2 Dynamo Minsk</p>
<p>(Belarus) 1 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
