<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Poltava: Vorskla Polatava (Ukraine) 2 Daugava Riga</p>
<p>(Latvia) 1 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Vorskla - Serhiy Chuichenko 30, Olexiy Antyukhin 58</p>
<p>Daugava - Renar Vutsans 49</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p>Vorskla win 5-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>In Baku: Karabakh Agdam (Azerbaijan) 0 Jablonec (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 3 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Malvin Prohazka 73, Jegi Holub 80, Milan Hukol 87</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p>Jablonec win 8-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Prilep: Pobeda Prilep (Macedonia) 2 Odra Wodzislaw</p>
<p>(Poland) 1 (0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Pobeda - Da Costa Oliveira 83, 87</p>
<p>Odra - Krzysztof Zagorski 18</p>
