<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Tiraspol:</p>
<p>Tiligul Tiraspol (Moldova) 1 Neuchatel Xamax (Switzerland) 3</p>
<p>(1-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Tiligul Tiraspol - Anatoly Lukyanchikov 14</p>
<p>Neuchatel Xamax - Sandjak 11, Martin 28, Genet 80</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
<p>Neuchatel Xamax win 10-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Stavanger: Viking Stavanger (Norway) 0  Vojvodina Novi</p>
<p>Sad (Yugoslavia) 2 (0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: Dragan Vulevic 4, 88</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,377</p>
<p>Aggregate score 2-2. Viking Stavanger won 5-4 on penalties</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Toftir: KI Klaksvik (Faroe Islands) 2 Ujpest (Hungary) 3</p>
<p>(1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>KI Klaksvik - Olgar Danielsen 14, Kurt Moerkoere 73</p>
<p>Ujpest - Karoly Szanyo 39, Vilmos Sebok 77, 89</p>
<p>Attendance: 205</p>
<p>Ukjpest win 9-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>In Bourgas: Neftochimik Bourgas (Bulgaria) 3 Brann Bergen</p>
<p>(Norway) 2 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Neftochimik Bourgas - Mitko Trendafilov 10, Velian Parushev</p>
<p>26, Todor Kiselichkov 72</p>
<p>Brann Bergen - Hartsmun 60, 82</p>
<p>Attendance - 17,000</p>
<p>Aggregate 4-4. Brann Bergen win on away goals rule</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Coleraine: Coleraine (Northern Ireland) 1 Grasshopper</p>
<p>Zurich (Switzerland) 7 (1-3)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Coleraine - O'Dowd 22</p>
<p>Grasshopper - Magnin 15, Esposito 27, Ahinful 33, Shiels 51</p>
<p>own goal, Tikva 63, Yakin 64, Aspinall 83 own goal.</p>
