<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Dundee: Dundee United (Scotland) 9 CE Principat (andorra)</p>
<p>0 (5-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: McSwegan 8, 24, 65, Winters 23, 42, Olafsson 55,</p>
<p>McLaren 37, Zetterlund 59, Thompson 88</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,695</p>
